{"articleNo":"113501","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=113501&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-2학기 생활관 건강검진 실시","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.09.11","hit":"3253","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2014학년도 2학기 생활관 입사자 건강검진을 다음과 같이 실시하고자 합니다.</span></span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>1. 대상</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014-2학기 생활관에 입사한 전 관생<font color=\"#e80000\"><u> </u></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#e80000\"><u>(2014-1학기 검진자도 포함)</u></font></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>2. 종목</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 결핵 (방사선검사)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>3. 기간</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> :<font color=\"#0900ff\"> <strong>푸름관, 오름관 ☞</strong> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2014. 9. 15(월) ～ 9. 17(수), 오후2시~6시</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신평관 ☞ <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2014. 9. 15(월), 오전10시~12시</font></strong></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>4. 장소</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>관리동 지하1층 탁구장 (※신평관 : 신평관 입구 경비실 앞)</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>5. 방법</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 구미 강동병원에서 방문 검진</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>6. 비용</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 무료 (생활관에서 지원)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\